WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.752
Priya: Last part. Let's close out the action items.
最后一段。把待办项定下来。

2
00:00:04.752 --> 00:00:08.281
Priya: So, who's picking up the PDB change?
那么，PDB 那个改动谁来接？

3
00:00:08.281 --> 00:00:11.665
Sam: Me. I'll have it Monday.
我。周一之前搞定。

4
00:00:11.665 --> 00:00:13.921
Priya: And the probe timeout?
探针超时呢？

5
00:00:13.921 --> 00:00:17.617
Sam: Same. I'll do both together.
一样。两件一起做。

6
00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:23.474
Priya: Good. Just to recap — aborting was right, but we were slow.
好。小结一下——中止是对的，但我们太慢了。

7
00:00:23.474 --> 00:00:24.458
Alex: Slow how?
慢在哪？

8
00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:29.690
Priya: We spent forty minutes heads-down on the node before we looked at the PDB.
我们在节点上埋头搞了四十分钟，才去看 PDB。

9
00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:32.354
Alex: To be fair, the dashboard didn't show it.
说公道话，看板确实没显示。

10
00:00:32.354 --> 00:00:39.027
Priya: Right. So third action item — surface PDB blocks in the console.
对。所以第三个待办——在看板上暴露 PDB 阻塞。

11
00:00:39.027 --> 00:00:43.467
Sam: That's a good one. I'll take point on it.
这个不错。我来主抓。

12
00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:49.947
Priya: Perfect. And one more — nobody checks the probe timeout before a drain.
好。还有一件——驱逐之前没人检查探针超时。

13
00:00:49.947 --> 00:00:52.900
Alex: That is a checklist item only. Not a project.
那只是清单上的一条，不算项目。

14
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.940
Priya: Exactly. Cheap, and it would have saved us an hour.
正是。成本很低，能省我们一小时。

